 musician, having released his debut album True That in 2014. Cera has also performed as the touring bassist for indie rock supergroup Mister Heavenly.","biography_language":"en","biography_source":"tmdb","birthday":"1988-06-07","checked_at":"2026-11-26","deathday":"","filmography":[{"character":"Bjorn Lund","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/90yhkAmFHypazSdnR0LXSf5e6h0.jpg","role":"","title":"La trama fenicia","tmdb_id":1137350,"type":"movie","year":2025},{"character":"Elton Perrakis","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/c7CAzgr2IIvwI6PlbfvFNfLtVRg.jpg","role":"","title":"The Running Man","tmdb_id":798645,"type":"movie","year":2025},{"character":"Barry (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hYAD3hBWRrheRXHdHzYyoYVZJTa.jpg","role":"","title":"Sausage Party: Cibopolis","tmdb_id":213249,"type":"tv","year":2024},{"character":"Allan","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/7e5xLiEvYbgSxmcjh7nkqqzxx6O.jpg","role":"","title":"Barbie","tmdb_id":346698,"type":"movie","year":2023},{"character":"Trent","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/tyDi5ltznCB51JHEtYfUOXOpiI8.jpg","role":"","title":"Dream Scenario - Hai mai sognato quest'uomo?","tmdb_id":823482,"type":"movie","year":2023},{"character":"Scott Pilgrim (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/rbjHNe9fHAT9Rx4gdohqbBz1sOq.jpg","role":"","title":"Scott Pilgrim: La serie","tmdb_id":155292,"type":"tv","year":2023},{"character":"Armen (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/iVTpqkG3KrJLpRjnz9RfGz1t1qN.jpg","role":"","title":"Under the Boardwalk","tmdb_id":609271,"type":"movie","year":2023},{"character":"John","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/6PuIZmC5NBvUskjV4i24gdXr8AM.jpg","role":"","title":"Life & Beth","tmdb_id":156812,"type":"tv","year":2022},{"character":"Great Wide Wonder (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/vyewvBp84vHODaT1EdJlSpM8xys.jpg","role":"","title":"The Boys Presenta: Diabolico!","tmdb_id":152483,"type":"tv","year":2022},{"character":"Sal